# Team Finance Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Team Finance.

Team Finance is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token infrastructure and lock contract security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Team Finance  
Audit type: Token lock and smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

